      "size_bytes": 132,
      "instruction_count": 39,
      "description": "Computes high orbit target relative to Ali ($FF19E8) based on facing +$16: facing 0 -> (+0x60, -0x30), facing 1 -> (-0x60, -0x30), facing 2 -> (0, -0x68). Clamps Y to minimum 200 ($00C8). Computes Chebyshev distance max(|dx|, |dy|) and selects speed tier: > 24 -> $00030000, 17..24 -> $00020000, <= 16 -> $00018000; resets timer +$2 = 4."
    },
